sim-tools-ns3 provides sim-tools' ns-3 modules, built on the ns3 port:

    find_package(sim-tools-ns3 CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ns3::routing-bench)

Headers: #include "ns3/routing-bench-module.h". The harness programs are in
tools/sim-tools-ns3/ (routing-compare --PrintHelp). x64-linux only.
